<title>AUSTRIA: ALPINE SKIING-MEN'S WORLD CUP GIANT SLALOM FIRST LEG TIMES.</title>
<headline>ALPINE SKIING-MEN'S WORLD CUP GIANT SLALOM FIRST LEG TIMES.</headline>
<dateline>SOELDEN, Austria 1996-10-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading first leg times</p>
<p>in a men's World Cup giant slalom on Sunday:</p>
<p>1. Steve Locher (Switzerland) 58.56 seconds</p>
<p>2. Michael von Gruenigen (Switzerland) 59.15</p>
<p>3. Lasse Kjus (Norway) 59.27</p>
<p>4. Rainer Salzgeber (Austria) 59.37</p>
<p>5. Guenter Mader (Austria) 59.62</p>
<p>6. Hans Knaus (Austria) 59.65</p>
<p>7. Ian Piccard (France) 59.80</p>
<p>8. Joseph Strobl (Austria) 59.84</p>
<p>9. Kjetil Andre Aamodt (Norway) 1:00.01</p>
<p>10. Jure Kosir (Slovenia) 1:00.18</p>
